# Naming

| Area | Spec |
| ---- | ---- |
| **`module/`** | **[docs/naming.md](../docs/naming.md)** — `utils.` \| `server.` \| `client.` + kebab slug + role postfix |
| **`features/`** | **[features/NAMING.md](../features/NAMING.md)** — `<feature>.<purpose>.<suffix>` under `src/{core/client,core/server,config,constants,types,utils}/` |
| **`packages/`** | Provider prefix + suffix under `src/{core,config,constants,types,utils}/` — **[docs/packages.md](../docs/packages.md)** |

## Module pattern (required on new files)

`<layer>.<kebab-slug>.<role>.<ext>` — layer is **`utils.`** | **`server.`** | **`client.`**

## Module must

- Controller: `server.<op>.controller.ts` + service: `server.<op>.service.ts`
- Zod: `utils.<topic>.validation.ts`
- UI: `client.<screen>.boundary.tsx`, `.content.tsx`, `.skeleton.tsx`
- Hooks: `client.use-<feature>-<op>.hook.ts`
- Tier 2: `client.section.layout.tsx`; Tier 1: `client.shell.layout.tsx`

## Module forbidden

- Files without layer prefix (`get-team.ts`)
- camelCase filenames
- Duplicate operation slug without `.controller` / `.service` postfix

## oRPC transport

New procedure wiring only: **`packages/orpc/src/orpc/procedures/<domain>.ts`** — delegate to **`@modules/.../server/...`**, not new logic under `packages/orpc/src/modules/`.
